摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Official DingTalk connector for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1340650048","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-dingtalk","slug":"DingTalk-Real-AI/dsh-dingtalk","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Official DingTalk connector for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH DingTalk"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"文件接收与回传：支持机器人单聊接收不超过 20 MB 的附件，并通过会话专属 `send_file` / `send_image` 工具将工作区内的文件或图片回传原单聊或群聊。文件格式、权限、平台限制"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"单聊接收不超过 20 MB 的附件，并通过会话专属 `send_file` / `send_image` 工具将工作区内的文件或图片回传原单聊或群聊。文件格式、权限、平台限制和使用方式见中文文件指南。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"简体中文 | English"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Connect local DeepSeek Harness (DSH) to DingTalk over a Stream connection, without a public inbound "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ocal DeepSeek Harness (DSH) to DingTalk over a Stream connection, without a public inbound endpoint."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0` is required. The bot works only while local `dsh web` is running and "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"the computer is online; it does not keep running in the cloud after sleep, network loss, or process "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"omputer is online; it does not keep running in the cloud after sleep, network loss, or process exit."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## AI Native setup (recommended)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"An AI agent can inspect the setup plan, execute explicitly approved non-secret steps, and resume fro"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"m a checkpoint. QR URLs, Client Secrets, and plaintext `/bind` codes are excluded from machine JSON "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"and checkpoints and are assigned to a separate terminal handoff that you operate yourself."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"You can give this prompt to an AI coding agent:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Resolve the stable release version first, then pin every step to that version:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Record the output as `<version>`, then generate a strictly read-only plan. Use `default` for a new i"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"nstallation; select an account explicitly when several already exist."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The plan only reads local configuration and the process table, and runs `dsh --version` and `pnpm --"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"version`. It never installs, writes files, creates binding codes, or controls processes. Its stable "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"output includes `planId`, actions, required approvals, and an `answerTemplate`. Replace every `null`"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" with an explicit choice and save the result as JSON:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Keep DSH or pnpm installation approval `false` when the plan does not request that action. Set it to"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" `true` only after explicit user approval; machine mode never assumes “yes.” Apply the plan with:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Common outcomes:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `status`                       | Next action                                                      "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"                                                                  |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `blocked`                      | A required approval is missing; revise the answers, then create a"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"nd apply a fresh plan.                                            |\n| `failed`                      "},{"id":"p22s3","text":" | Inspect stable `error.code` / `stepId`; raw subprocess errors are never copied into machine outpu"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"t.                                |\n| `awaiting_private_credentials` | In a separate local terminal,"},{"id":"p22s5","text":" run the same version with `setup --resume <checkpoint-id>` and personally scan or enter credentials"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"e version with `setup --resume <checkpoint-id>` and personally scan or enter credentials. |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Interactive setup"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Without AI orchestration, use the original guided flow:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The guide checks DSH and pnpm, asks before installing a missing or incompatible dependency, installs"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" this exact connector version, collects credentials, configures DWS, image and access policies, crea"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"tes the owner-binding code, and offers to start `dsh web`. It never upgrades an existing DSH install"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ation automatically."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"`npx` runs the CLI for this invocation and does not add `dsh-dingtalk` to PATH. New accounts initial"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ly allow all senders and groups; for personal use, prefer owner-only sender access and no group acce"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ss, then expand deliberately."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Enterprise private npm registries"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"While DSH is in prerelease, the registry must contain the matching prerelease versions of the main p"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ackage and all of its child packages. Enterprise registries such as Nexus, Verdaccio, or self-hosted"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" cnpm can fail with `ETARGET`, `notarget`, or `ERR_PNPM_NO_MATCHING_VERSION` when only some packages"},{"id":"p29s4","text":" have synchronized. This means the selected registry is missing a required version; it is not a conn"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"ector configuration error."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Before installing the plugin, setup reads `npm config get registry` and writes the registry without "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"URL-embedded credentials to `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/.npmrc` (default: `~/.dsh/profiles/web/.npmrc`)."},{"id":"p30s3","text":" This keeps the outer npm process and the pnpm process launched by DSH on the same registry while pr"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"eserving scoped registries, authentication, and other existing `.npmrc` settings. If the enterprise "},{"id":"p30s5","text":"registry is incomplete, retry once with a registry that has the complete package set; the override n"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"ow also reaches the later pnpm step:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"You can also set and verify the web profile's project-level registry manually. Replace the directory"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" when using a custom `DSH_HOME`:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## How to use it: manual steps or assisted execution"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"You can mix both modes, and you always start the task:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"1. **Operate locally:** run `npx @dingtalk-real-ai/dsh-dingtalk@latest setup` in a terminal to chang"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"e settings, or `npx @dingtalk-real-ai/dsh-dingtalk@latest doctor` to inspect the connection. To stop"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" the service, press `Ctrl+C` in the terminal running `dsh web`.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- Direct messages and configured group chats.\n- Guided access policies for all senders, owner-only, "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"or selected sender staff IDs, and for all, no, or selected groups.\n- AI Card streaming, Markdown and"},{"id":"p38s3","text":" text replies.\n- Native DSH session persistence, model selection, workspace switching, cancellation "},{"id":"p38s4","text":"and queues.\n- DSH user questions, Plan Review and fail-closed sensitive-operation approval via owner"},{"id":"p38s5","text":"-only text codes or optional interactive cards.\n- QR-based DingTalk app registration with manual Cli"},{"id":"p38s6","text":"ent ID / Client Secret fallback.\n- Multiple DingTalk bot accounts in one `dsh web` process, with iso"},{"id":"p38s7","text":"lated credentials, Stream connections, owner bindings and runtime state.\n- Optional DWS tools and a "},{"id":"p38s8","text":"bundled DWS skill.\n- Picture and mixed image/text `richText` intake with `auto`, `always` and `never"},{"id":"p38s9","text":"` modes. `auto` reads the active DSH model's `inputModalities` metadata.\n- Owner binding, per-chat a"},{"id":"p38s10","text":"uthorization and deduplication.\n- Read-only diagnostics through `doctor`."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Only the DSH `web` profile is supported in the first release. macOS and Linux are supported; Windows"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"` profile is supported in the first release. macOS and Linux are supported; Windows is experimental."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
